        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 850, 1.25 Inch Diameter Balance Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/4 Inch Balance Cabinet Knob is available in stunning finish color options. The Balance Cabinet Knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware. This simple knob is sure to add big style to your kitchen cabinets. It can also be used as a furniture pull or in the bathroom on the vanity. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"/site/search.cfm?search=MNG+ Balance\">MNG Balance Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 850 Balance Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
